## 2. MAIN.PY ARCHITECTURE AUDIT (HIGHEST PRIORITY)

### Scale
- **Total Lines:** 12,162
- **Total Size:** 534,663 bytes (~522 KB)
- **Total Route Decorators:** 283 `@app.*` declarations
- **Unique URL Paths:** ~175 unique routes (many have dual `/api/` and non-`/api/` aliases)

### Responsibilities Identified

| Category | Approximate Lines | Details |
|----------|------------------|---------|
| Startup / Migrations | ~350 | `run_migrations()` — 30+ DDL statements run at startup |
| Pydantic Schemas | ~200 | 25+ `BaseModel` classes inline |
| Auth Helpers | ~150 | JWT creation, verification, bcrypt, role guards |
| Auth Routes | ~500 | Login, register, logout, refresh, forgot-password, change-password |
| Institution/Platform Admin | ~600 | Apply, approve, reject, platform stats |
| Admin CRUD | ~1,500 | Faculty, Students, Classes, Subjects, Courses, Departments, Enrollments, Terms |
| Faculty Routes | ~2,000 | Classes, attendance, marks, analytics, assignments, workload, notifications |
| Student Routes | ~1,200 | Hub, profile, attendance, grades, notes, calendar, programming hub |
| AI Mentor (old) | ~400 | `/api/v1/ai/chat` — Gemini-based, with large inline fallback responses |
| AI Mentor (new) | ~300 | `/api/v1/mentor/*` — Groq-based, session-managed |
| Learning Wellness | ~1,500 | Check-ins, focus sessions, reflections, preferences, statistics |
| Career Module | ~700 | Profile, analyze, interview evaluation |
| Academic Prediction | ~500 | ML prediction, history, student stats |
| Gamification | ~800 | Badges, leaderboard, XP, streaks |
| Notifications | ~600 | Student & faculty notifications, read/unread |
| Announcements | ~500 | CRUD with targeting, read tracking |
| Remedial Sessions | ~700 | Full lifecycle: create, update, start, complete, cancel |
| Security Events | ~150 | Login/register audit logs |
| Domains/Roadmap | ~300 | Dynamic domain registry |
| Analytics | ~500 | Faculty analytics dashboard, risk engine |
| Helper Functions | ~300 | `log_audit`, `create_notification`, `log_faculty_activity`, `verify_faculty_access` |
| Miscellaneous | ~300 | Settings, branding, configuration endpoints |

### API Groups & Route Count

| Module | Route Count |
|--------|-------------|
| Authentication | 6 |
| Institution / Platform Admin | 12 |
| Admin CRUD (Students, Faculty, Classes, etc.) | 40 |
| Faculty (classes, assignments, attendance, marks) | 35 |
| Student Hub | 15 |
| AI Mentor (Groq-based) | 8 |
| AI Chat (Gemini-based, old) | 3 |
| Learning Wellness | 18 |
| Career & Academic Prediction | 8 |
| Gamification & Domains | 10 |
| Notifications & Announcements | 18 |
| Remedial Sessions | 10 |
| Miscellaneous/Debug | 5 |
| **Total** | **~188 logical routes** |

> Note: 283 decorators because many routes are registered under both `/api/route` and `/route` as aliases.

### Route Duplication Pattern (Important)
Almost every route is registered **twice**:
```python
@app.get("/api/faculty/{faculty_id}/classes")
@app.get("/faculty/{faculty_id}/classes")   # ← duplicate alias
```
This is a deliberate backward-compatibility pattern. It works but creates 90+ redundant registrations. The `/api/` prefix versions are canonical; the non-prefixed ones should be deprecated post-stabilization.

