### Authentication Security Assessment

| Check | Status | Notes |
|-------|--------|-------|
| Password hashing | ✅ Good | bcrypt with salt |
| JWT access token | ✅ Good | HS256, includes type claim |
| JWT refresh rotation | ✅ Good | Old refresh token blacklisted on use |
| Token blacklist | ✅ Good | DB-backed blacklist table |
| Cookie security | ✅ Good | `httponly=True`, `secure=True`, `samesite=lax` |
| Brute force protection | ⚠️ Partial | In-memory dict — not multi-process safe |
| Rate limiting middleware | ❌ Missing | No global rate limiting |
| `secure=True` on cookies | ✅ Set | Requires HTTPS in production |
| HTTPS enforcement | ❌ Not configured | No redirect middleware |
| SQL injection | ✅ Protected | All queries use parameterized `text()` |

