## 11. LOGGING AUDIT

| Finding | Count | Severity |
|---------|-------|----------|
| `print()` statements in production code | 19 | 🟠 High |
| No structured logging (no `logging` module) | — | 🟠 High |
| Exception details leaked via `str(e)` in API responses | ~100 | 🟠 High |
| No request/response logging middleware | — | Medium |
| No log levels (DEBUG, INFO, ERROR) | — | Medium |

**Key `print()` locations:**
- Line 331: `"Migrations executed successfully!"`
- Line 341: `"Error executing migrations: {e}"`
- Line 520: `"Error loading student performance model: {e}"`
- Line 4465: `"Gemini API streaming error: {e}"`
- Line 10089: `"Error enriching activity context: {ex}"`

**Recommended fix:**
```python
import logging
logger = logging.getLogger("neurolearn")
# Replace all print() with logger.info() / logger.error()
```

